                >✓</span
              >
              <span class="text-base">Network security fundamentals</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start mb-1 gap-3">
              <span
                class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 group-hover:text-green-300 transition-colors"
                >✓</span
              >
              <span class="text-base">Data protection strategies</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start mb-1 gap-3">
              <span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 group-hover:text-green-300 transition-colors">✓</span>
              <span class="text-base">Complete SQL coding — Data Analist job-ready</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start mb-1 gap-3">
              <span
                class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 group-hover:text-green-300 transition-colors"
                >✓</span
              >
              <span class="text-base">Private community channel</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start mb-1 gap-3">
              <span
                class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 group-hover:text-green-300 transition-colors"
                >✓</span
              >
              <span class="text-base">New courses added · always included</span>
