      </div>

      <div id="testimonials" class="flex gap-6 md:grid md:grid-cols-3 font-outfit text-dark/90 text-justify overflow-x-auto md:overflow-visible snap-x snap-mandatory pb-6 md:pb-0">
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-primary/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-xl w-[calc(100vw-2rem)] md:w-auto md:min-w-0 snap-start md:min-w-0 flex-shrink-0">
          <p class="mb-6 text-lg italic text-dark/80">"She's not just a teacher, she's a truly inspiring guide."</p>
          <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-dark/70">Ana teaches with a passion and dedication that's rare. She opens real doors to entrepreneurship and a future full of opportunities. Since joining the community I finally feel supported and equipped to build something of my own.</p>
          <div class="border-t border-primary/10 pt-4">
            <p class="font-bold text-primary">Fiorella R.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-dark/60">Community member · Chile</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-primary/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-xl w-[calc(100vw-2rem)] md:w-auto md:min-w-0 snap-start md:min-w-0 flex-shrink-0">
          <p class="mb-6 text-lg italic text-dark/80">"From zero to fully prepared to live from the digital world."</p>
          <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-dark/70">I arrived energetic and left with a clear roadmap. I learned to build my website, sell digital products, and use AI to work ten times faster. I didn't expect to find so much in one place: business strategy, tech skills and a genuine community.</p>
          <div class="border-t border-primary/10 pt-4">
            <p class="font-bold text-primary">Valentina M.</p>
